We notice that being involved with setting up the PC version,
responding to mail, and fixing reported bugs, we do not have
enough play-testing time.  Patch 7 is intended to be the last
3.0 patch, and we should try to make sure that the product is
clean of bugs (at least deadly ones).  We are asking for your
help in play-testing and hunting down bugs for the next two weeks.
Get into wizard mode (if you can) or discovery mode, and PUSH THE
GAME AROUND.  Give it "the works", and please report to us directly
(nethack-bugs@linc.cis.upenn.edu) any bug you find.  Thank you all.

For the development team,

-Izchak

p.s. An Install.binary is now housed on linc's pub/NH3.0/PC.  Even
     if you already grabbed the overlay binary package from that area,
     please pick up Install.binary and store it -- You might end up
     distributing your copy of the binary package to others.


